# sby work directories + generated formal models.
# MAINTENANCE TRAP: this list enumerates task suffixes one by one, so every
# new sby task name needs a new line here. Forgetting one does not fail the
# formal run -- it fails `reuse lint`, because the generated work dir then
# shows up as an untracked file without licensing information (that is how
# *_tereqrst was found, AP0 merge 2026-08-16).
*/build/
*/*_prove/
*/*_cover/
*/*_bmc/
*/*_live/
*/*_livecover/
*/*_red/
*/*_quota/
*/*_quotacover/
*/*_tereq/
*/*_tereqcover/
*/*_tereqrst/
*/*_tereqrstcover/
*/*_bmc0/
*/*_bmc1/
*/*_prv0/
*/*_prv1/
*/*_reqcoll/
*/*_reqcollcover/
*/*_mut/
# jobname-dirs from task-less sby invocations
*/msg_gen/
*/ovf_injector/
*/preproc_sync/
*/mseo_mdo/
*/nexus_formatter/
*/composer_slots/
